first

- npm install

on both client and root

install Ganache

open ganache with a custom "New Workspace" with ethereum of 1000

open Metamask

- click add a custom network
- give a name
- give the RPC URL from ganache
- give the chainID as 1337 if it is not automatically filled
- then click on save
- then click on the down arrow on the accont name
- click on the "+ Add account or hardware wallet"
- click on "import account"
- then go to ganache
- click on the "key icon"
- copy the private key
- paste it on metamask
- click import

now go to vs code

open a terminal
on the terminal

- npx truffle compile

- truffle migrate --reset --network development

this is compile and deploy the samrt contracts to the localnet

then from the "build/contracts"

copy all the contents from the certification.json, institution.json, Migrations.json to - Certification.json, Institution.json, Migration.json on the "client/src/contracts/"

on the terminal there is something like
"Institution deployed to - 0x0....."

copy the address and paste it in the

"client/src/app/(dashboard)/admin/page.jsx"

there will be const
INSTITUTION_CONTRACT_ADDRESS = "0x949149Cb18DCF0F28a95CF188a6DC8693eF1349F";

replace the address with the new address in the teminal that is copied

now open a new terminal

- cd client

- npm run dev
